      "party": "Republican",
      "incumbent": true,
      "summary": "Mark Alford is the incumbent U.S. Representative for Missouri's 4th Congressional District, first elected in 2022. A former television news anchor for WDAF-TV in Kansas City for 23 years, Alford serves on the House Appropriations Committee and has been a vocal supporter of tariffs, Israel aid, and federal workforce reductions. He faces primary challenges from Heather Shelton and Scott Vincent Vera in the August 4, 2026 Republican primary.",
